  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Ported SetInputUnitsEx, AwaitModelHandle, OpenStaadModel, CloseCurrentStaadModel and CloseWriteReopenStaadFile with matching complete XML IntelliSense. Added validated unit codes, exact full-path identity polling, monotonic deadlines and guarded existing-file replacement with bounded close/lock waiting. Retained caller-thread, binding and lifetime guards. Thirty Root operations are implemented; see the model coordination guide for partial effects and native qualification limits.",
